  "description": "Ab3d.PowerToys is the ultimate WPF and WinForms 3D toolkit library that greatly simplifies developing desktop applications with scientific, technical, CAD or other 3D graphics.\n\nSamples project:\nhttps://github.com/ab4d/Ab3d.PowerToys.Wpf.Samples\n\nHomepage:\nhttps://www.ab4d.com/PowerToys.aspx\n\nOnline reference help:\nhttps://www.ab4d.com/help/PowerToys/html/R_Project_Ab3d_PowerToys.htm\n\nChange log:\nhttps://www.ab4d.com/PowerToys-history.aspx\n\nSupported platforms:\n- .NET Framework 4.0+\n- .NET 6.0\n- .NET 8.0\n- .NET 9.0",
